11	 * Two variants selectable by argv:
12	 *   numeric-only   (default): just the factorization (method1's 1.0% rate).
13	 *   compute-both  (argv[2]="both"): recompute the chain twice and cross-check
14	 *                  (method1's 0.27% rate — the 4x lower rate under redundancy).
15	 *   The numeric/compute ratio is method1's state-leak signature (target ∈[2,8]).
16	 *
