59	 * long-lived accumulator: fmadd across the j<k sub-loop, fmsub to update,
60	 * fsqrt for the diagonal, str to store. A residue fault on d0 mid-loop
61	 * returns another variable's value -> multi-bit x[0] aliasing. */
62	static void factorize(double L[N][N]) {
